      "writtenOn": "2026-06-18T22:10:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "oops typo, I meant `EXPECT_DEATH_IF_SUPPORTED`. Tint uses that everywhere (instead of `EXPECT_DEATH`):\nhttps://source.chromium.org/search?q\u003df:%5Ethird_party%2Fdawn%2Fsrc%2Ftint%20expect_death\u0026sq\u003d\u0026ss\u003dchromium\n\nI don\u0027t know why tint_unittests is building these files, because they\u0027re only depended on by dawn_unittests, but it happened somehow. I\u0027ll see if I can figure it out",
      "parentUuid": "e589654b_a3215965",
      "range": {
